{
  "scope": "DRAFT, not approved. New payout rules behind the payouts.payrollAndAttribution flag: attribution money (US7.13); payroll salary lines (US7.16, AC7.10.3): floor(salary x days employed / days in the month). Each sale's unassigned pool is given as an input: it is the instructor pool of a sale with no section owner, floor(amount x 7000 / 10000), from the already-approved split rule; hybrid lines (US7.27): salary + floor(attributed x shareBps / 10000), replacing the ledger's default 70% credit for those sales (a salary policy's share is 0).",
