      "kind": "attribution",
      "explanation": "A 4-section course had no owners. Sale P1 (BDT 1,200) left 84000 unassigned, sale P2 (BDT 999.99) left 69999. Tasnim is confirmed owner of section s1, so she gets one quarter of each sale's pool, rounded down: 84000/4 = 21000 and 69999/4 = 17499.75 -> 17499. Moved 38499. With 10000 earned elsewhere, her next cycle pays 10000 + 38499 = 48499. The pool keeps 153999 - 38499 = 115500.",
      "input": {
        "month": "2027-02",
        "sectionId": "s1",
        "ownerId": "tasnim",
        "sales": [
          {
            "paymentId": "P1",
            "unassigned": 84000,
            "sectionIds": ["s1", "s2", "s3", "s4"]
          },
          {
            "paymentId": "P2",
            "unassigned": 69999,
            "sectionIds": ["s1", "s2", "s3", "s4"]
          }
