      "explanation": "Tasnim is hybrid: salary BDT 20,000 (2000000) plus 1500 bp. In April 2027 she works the full month and sales of her sections total 1000000. Line = 2000000 + floor(1000000 x 1500 / 10000) = 2000000 + 150000 = 2150000 (AC7.27.1). The ledger had credited her the default 70% (700000), so the cycle adjusts by 150000 - 700000 = -550000 back to platform revenue.",
